{"id":"Cfb22a4628802169529a1","zh":"减振垫浮置板","en":"vibration-reduction pad floating slab","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","definition_zh":"以减振垫支承浮置板实现隔振的轨道结构。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于降低轨道振动向隧道的传递，通过道床板下的减振垫提供弹性支承，利用这一支承层实现浮置板的隔振作用。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"Cfb22a4628802169529a1","zh":"减振垫浮置板","en":"vibration-reduction pad floating slab","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","group_id":"H1c4009381ad3664119e3","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"环境振动与轨道减振 · 陈宪麦等（2025）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D45e61a4880f3110f3b99","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"减振垫浮置板"},{"id":"Df1f1993674024abbe0a4","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"vibration-reduction pad floating slab"}],"sources":{"P137":{"id":"P137","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","authors":"陈宪麦,黄厚龙,徐磊,胡逸宁,仵雷振,邓燚","year":"2025","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2025.01.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"陈宪麦等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S043ee8e6fd4a4b7a13a4","source_id":"P137","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"In this paper, a certain section of a city railway track with vibration-reduction pad floating slab was taken as the research object.","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S6c0afa1ad491cb1c3889","source_id":"P137","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"Therefore, achieving low dynamic design of the vibration-reduction pad floating slab system through appropriate parameter matching is particularly important.","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sfd29301dcb21c07f109a","source_id":"P137","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"目前,在地下线路中应用最广泛的是隔振技术,包括减振扣件[12]、减振垫浮置板[13]以及钢弹簧浮置板[14]等。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sccff39a870dfb2b2fa22","source_id":"P137","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"减振垫和减振扣件虽能有效减振,但其低刚度特性会增大钢轨和道床板位移,影响车辆运行的平稳性和舒适性,因此,如何通过合理的参数匹配实现减振垫浮置板系统的低动力响应设计显得尤为重要。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C01b7407b04d965c00d14","target_concept_id":"C01b7407b04d965c00d14","target_zh":"参数匹配","target_en":"parameter matching","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_concept_id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic responses","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C5170b178048574db0700","target_concept_id":"C5170b178048574db0700","target_zh":"市域铁路","target_en":"city railway","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P137","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","authors":"陈宪麦,黄厚龙,徐磊,胡逸宁,仵雷振,邓燚","year":"2025","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2025.01.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"陈宪麦等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff"}]}